1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,800
How to apply your sticker
6 easy steps

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,300
1. Clean and dry the bin
Wash with soapy water and dry it fully. Best above about 10°C.

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:13,800
2. Peel the narrow strip
Bend the sticker at the back cut and peel off the strip marked PEEL THIS FIRST.

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:19,300
3. Line it up and stick the top edge
Press the exposed strip onto the bin.

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:24,800
4. Peel and smooth down
Pull the rest of the backing away slowly, smoothing from the stuck edge downwards as you go.

6
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,300
5. Press the edges
Press firmly along all edges and corners.

7
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:35,800
6. Wait 3 days before washing
No washing or scrubbing for 3 days. Ordinary rain is fine.

8
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:39,500
Thank you!
Enjoy your new sticker
